an>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    thiah’khui siōng-hún jiâh-jāi-thia̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">寫<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">샤ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">滿<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">뽠ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">溫柔<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">운ˉ뜌ˊ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">笑容<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">쵸`영ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    siâ-boân-ūn-riú’e chiò-yóng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">是<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">시-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">美麗<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">삐ˆ레ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">陪伴<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">붸퐐ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    si-bî-lē’e pue-phoā̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">是<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">시-</rt></ruby>음<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">是<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">시-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">凍<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">당`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">過<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">궤`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">霜雪<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">승ˉ셓</rt></ruby> 음<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">知<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">재ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">寒<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">괄ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    si-m-si-tàng-kuè-sn̄g-seh m-jāi-koá̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">失去<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">싣ˆ킈</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">了後<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">ᄅᆤˆᄋᅷˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">才<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">쟣ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">知<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">재ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">輸贏<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">수ˉ얄ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    sît-khi liâu-āu jiâh-jāi-sū-yá̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">原來<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">꽌래-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">今生<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">김ˉ솅ˆ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">孤單<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">거ˉ돨ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    goan-lai-kīm-siêng’e kōr-toâ̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">直<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">딛-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">란<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">初<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">처ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">見面<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">길`삔ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">時<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">시ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    tit-làn chōr-kḭ̀-bīn’e sí\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    됴<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">已經<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">이ˆ곙ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">註定<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">주`댤ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    tio-î-kiēng-jù-tiā̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n"
